{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321110001:1":{"text":"アローナ、またお祈りしてたの？信心深いだけではシスターになれないのよ。なんでも口答えする悪い癖を直さなきゃ。","source_cn":"阿廖娜，你又来做祝祷啦？光凭虔诚地祈祷，可没办法成为侍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BB4B0DE45727B85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321110002:1":{"text":"……もうずいぶん直したわよ！","source_cn":"……我已经改正很多了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D3FE8E122083763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321110003:1":{"text":"それで、あなたこそ何してるのよ？伝説の絶景探しは終わったの？","source_cn":"倒是你，怎么在这里？没去找传说中的风景吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AF58C66703061A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321110004:1":{"text":"ちょっと！なんで知ってるのよ！？アルファスに話してないわよね！？","source_cn":"啊！你怎么知道的？！你没有告诉阿尔希普吧？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6E386BBA4F93FF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321110005:1":{"text":"もちろんでしょ。私がそんなことすると思う？","source_cn":"当然没有。我哪会做这种事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA339009A316681D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321110006:1":{"text":"とぼけないで、あなたのことはあたしが一番知ってるのよ。とにかく……話したら許さないから！","source_cn":"别装了，我还不知道你？总之……这次你不许告诉阿尔希普！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0E234DA747BD6F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321110007:1":{"text":"ところで、聞きたいことがあるんだけど。素直に答えてね！？\n――あなたが一番行ってみたい場所はどこ？","source_cn":"对了，我正好有个问题想问你，你肯定能答上来！\\n——你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49029CA5357920B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321110008:1":{"text":"……「伝説の絶景」って言えば？そんな遠回りな聞き方しないでさ。","source_cn":"……这是“你说最美风景会在哪呢”的前置问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB32A9E8EDC9D023A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321110009:1":{"text":"――ほらまた！それよ、それ！","source_cn":"——你又和我顶嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F3EDE13E04E0FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321110010:1":{"text":"ああ、ごめんごめん！真面目に答えるから！一番行きたい場所ね……","source_cn":"啊啊对不起，我错了！我认真回答！让我想想看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54EFB9CBDD3764CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321110011:1":{"text":"私たち敬虔な信徒にとっては、もちろん<style=\"highlight\">大聖堂</style>よ！あそこのシスターになれるのなら、一生エビを食べられなくてもいい！","source_cn":"像我这么虔诚的信徒，最向往的地方当然是<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC72A80E1ABA2F55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321110012:1":{"text":"なるほど、大聖堂か……確かに女神様の祝福を受けてる可能性が高そう！","source_cn":"有道理……白山大教堂最为神圣，很可能就是受到女神祝福的地方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EA2AE8E024CD273","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321110013:1":{"text":"やっぱり伝説の場所を探してるんじゃない。","source_cn":"你果然还在找那个传说中的地方啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB731D5C202A3DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321110014:1":{"text":"そうよ。それで修道者に聞いたら、いろんな人の意見を仰いでみなさいって言われたの。","source_cn":"是啊，修士说，也许其他人的意见能给我提供一些线索，所以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE391057BB2B12BA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321110015:1":{"text":"あっ、もう行くね。他の人にも聞いてみたいと！ありがとう！","source_cn":"啊，不和你说了，我得多问几个人才行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE58724F2907BF2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:娜塔莎":{"text":"ナターシャ","source":"娜塔莎